<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-160.1-mobility-strategy-policy-and-assignment-framework" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4697" name="W4697. Global Mobility Strategy, Policy &amp; Assignment-Tax Framework" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Talent/business strategy (VS-33); new foreign-hire need; annual review
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: 1 global-mobility strategy &amp; policy
Owner: Head of Global Mobility / HR Strategy
Participants: CHRO (VS-19), CFO/Controller (VS-17), Tax (VS-79), Legal (VS-100.3), Chief Security Officer (VS-159), Strategy (VS-33)
Source: workflow W4697 — Global Mobility Strategy, Policy &amp; Assignment-Tax Framework</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4697_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4697_Lane1" name="Head of Global Mobility">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4697_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4697_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4697_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4697_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4697_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4697_Start3" name="Talent/business strategy (VS-33); new foreign-hire need; annual review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4697_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4697_Task4" name="Define the global-mobility strategy and policy aligned to talent and business…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Define the global-mobility strategy and policy aligned to talent and business strategy (VS-33): when to deploy foreign expertise vs. develop local talent (VS-123 apprenticeship), the assignment-tax framework, and the governance with Legal/Tax/Chief Security Officer (VS-159)
Responsible (R): Head of Global Mobility / CHRO / Tax
Accountable (A): CHRO / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4697_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4697_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4697_Task5" name="Set assignment-tax principles: residency determination (resident vs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Set assignment-tax principles: residency determination (resident vs. non-resident), tax-treaty application, 19-series withholding for non-residents, tax-equalization vs. tax-protection, and home/host split (W4714)
Responsible (R): Head of Global Mobility / Tax / Legal
Accountable (A): CHRO / CFO / VP Tax
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4697_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4697_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4697_Task6" name="Obtain leadership endorsement; publish the mobility policy and assignment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Obtain leadership endorsement; publish the mobility policy and assignment handbook; train HR/business leaders on when/how to initiate an assignment (intake to W4702)
Responsible (R): Head of Global Mobility / CHRO
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4697_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4697_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4697_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4697_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4697_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-710 (ensure controlled execution — Mobility Strategy, Policy &amp; Assignment Framework (PA-160.1).) | - CTL-710: mobility policy CHRO/CFO-endorsed; assignment-tax framework Tax-led (VS-79); assignments initiated via policy intake
Owner: Head of Global Mobility / HR Strategy</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4697_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4697_Annotation8" targetRef="W4697_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4697_Flow10" sourceRef="W4697_Start3" targetRef="W4697_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4697_Flow11" sourceRef="W4697_Task4" targetRef="W4697_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4697_Flow12" sourceRef="W4697_Task5" targetRef="W4697_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4697_Flow13" sourceRef="W4697_Task6" targetRef="W4697_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
